|| Yet Another Network Simulator (YANS) ||
~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=

   A very simple OSI model compliant network simulator in C++.

   No fancy tricks. No bells and whistles. (thanks to my friend [vs-123](https://github.com/vs-123))

~=~=~=~=~=~
|| STACK ||
~=~=~=~=~=~

~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=
|| PREREQUISTES ||
~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=

   This project requires the following:
   
   o   LLVM clang    (C Compiler)
   o   GNU Make      (Build System)

~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=
|| HOW TO BUILD ||
~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=~=

   Assuming you have the prerequisites, you may use the following make commands:
   o   [BUILD] make b
   o   [RUN]   make r
   o   [CLEAN] make c

